title: FourAnswerTest
---
<<declare $selectedPath = "">>

Narrator: The desert sky deepens into darkness.
Anubis: Four doors stand sealed in the chamber beyond. Rest, and choose at dawn.

<<fadetoday BackgroundManager>>

<<setpuzzle 𓀀𓁐𓃀:Path_A|𓁷𓎟𓅓:Path_B|𓌱𓈖𓅓:Path_C|𓎟𓀀𓈖:Path_D>>
Pharaoh: Find 𓀀𓁐𓃀 for the sun.<br>Find 𓁷𓎟𓅓 for the river.<br>Find 𓌱𓈖𓅓 for the tomb.<br>Find 𓎟𓀀𓈖 for the stars. #wordsearch

<<if $selectedPath == "Path_A">>
    Pharaoh: The sun's light floods the chamber. 𓀀𓁐𓃀
<<elseif $selectedPath == "Path_B">>
    Pharaoh: The river's waters rush through ancient channels. 𓁷𓎟𓅓
<<elseif $selectedPath == "Path_C">>
    Pharaoh: The tomb yawns open into darkness. 𓌱𓈖𓅓
<<elseif $selectedPath == "Path_D">>
    Pharaoh: The stars wheel overhead as the door parts. 𓎟𓀀𓈖
<<endif>>

Narrator: Your path is chosen. The way ahead awaits.

<<fadetonight BackgroundManager>>
Narrator: Night returns over the sands.
===
